# Repository-wide ignores.
#
# This is a multi-project monorepo, so this file deliberately covers only what
# is true regardless of language: OS and editor droppings, local secrets, and
# scratch output. Anything specific to a stack belongs to the project that uses
# it — see projects/ac-g2-sil/sil-rig/.gitignore for the Node/TypeScript rules.

# --- macOS / Windows / Linux desktop litter ---------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editors and IDEs -------------------------------------------------------
# .vscode is not ignored wholesale: shared launch/task/extension recommendations
# are worth committing in a repo people are meant to clone and run.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Local secrets ----------------------------------------------------------
# The rig generates its own self-signed TLS material in memory, so nothing here
# should ever exist; this is a backstop, not a description of current practice.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore

# --- Scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
tmp/
.tmp/
